<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</title>
<headline>Pakistan gold prices seen mixed on low demand.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan gold prices are likely to remain mixed this week because of low demand in the Moslem month of Muharram, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Silver prices were likely to remain depressed due to low physical offtake of jewellery, one dealer said.</p>
<p>							 Saturday   May 3</p>
<p>    Gold 24 carat in rupees per 10 grams   4,672	4,565</p>
<p>    Silver per 1,000 grammes		   6,600	6,687</p>
<p>($1 = 40.43 rupees) -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
